 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you doing? Lovely. Some people do this annually, it great way to get something for everyone while still having something yourself. The water is fine, it' just a small stream. Would you rather it was quiet or beeping? You can switch between them themselves. Front and back are separate, though. You can always stop by the shop and try out some other ones too. Many aren't. Some doorbells even open with a light switch. Go with quiet rotating one for the front, and a cheap beeping one for the back where nobody cares if it beeps. They do. Some kids will stay up all night pressing it.",
